{# The privacy policy's paragraph on go.cam, included by privacy-policy.en.html.twig when it is the age verification provider in use (see AgeVerificationProviderInterface) #}
<h3 data-legal-id="third-parties.age-verification">Age verification (go.cam)</h3>
<div>
	Adult-only content is protected by an age verification entrusted to go.cam. As soon as a page carrying such content is shown, the go.cam service is loaded and receives your IP address, information about your browser and the address of the page. If you start the verification, go.cam estimates your age from your camera's picture or checks an identity document: these pictures are processed by go.cam under its own privacy policy, and only the result reaches us, with no picture and no identity.
</div>
